  "details": "so heres what im noticing.\n\nanyone who has played with the beta, and reverted back to live, shows up in my friends list with what world they are in. usually with the last status message they had before reverting\n\nBut if they haven't messed with the beta yet, they show up as being in a private world. and I know its a bug, because if I request an invite, everyone else in the same situation, (shows up as private) their join buttons all say \"request sent\"\n\nI double checked in the friend parser too, and they are clearly in a world, friends+",
